The test vehicle approaches the intersection at target speed V1. The cyclist waiting to cross the pedestrian crossing are positioned to the left/right of the target lane, maintaining a distance D from the lane centerline. The cyclist crosses the pedestrian crossing at speed V2 to the left/right of the target lane. During the test vehicle's straight passage through the intersection, the time required for the test vehicle to reach the collision point is identical to the time required for the cyclist to reach the collision point.